</ol>
<div class="highlight highlight-text-md notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="The **`property_name`** CSS shorthand property ...&quot; "><pre class="notranslate">The <span class="pl-s">**</span><span class="pl-s">`</span><span class="pl-c1">property_name</span><span class="pl-s">`</span><span class="pl-s">**</span> CSS shorthand property ..." </pre></div>
