        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45339</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45339"/>
        <updated>2026-08-27T06:26:07.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61856979?u=2ae56839a2779c62b750f6f2e1e049edb283def2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Replaces the format-by-format list on the img element page with concise guidance about choosing formats based on compression, browser support, and image requirements. It also explains fallbacks and the progressive-rendering benefit of JPEG XL for large images.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The previous list called several competing formats a good choice without clearly explaining how to decide between them. This revision directs readers to WebP or AVIF for raster compression, SVG for scalable graphics, and picture-based fallbacks where browser support requires them.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Markdownlint: passed</li>
<li>Prettier check: passed</li>
<li>Updated the affected internal heading link</li>
