<p dir="auto">Firefox 155 adds support for the <a href="https://github.com/WebAssembly/wide-arithmetic/blob/main/proposals/wide-arithmetic/Overview.md">Wasm wide arithmetic proposal</a>; see <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2062374" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2062374</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">The proposal adds four new Wasm instructions:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">add128</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">sub128</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">mul_wide_s</code></li>
